{"key":"c113d947-5dcf-4a52-aaa2-735dba1089b7","installationKey":"1de87984-ce7c-407c-988c-a28014ae53ad","publishingOrganizationKey":"e794e60e-e558-4549-99f8-cfb241cdce24","doi":"10.15468/zhkuay","external":false,"numConstituents":0,"type":"OCCURRENCE","title":"NEON Biorepository Herptile Voucher Collection (Ground Beetle Sampling Bycatch Trap Sorting)","description":"<p>\r\nUnpooled catches of herptile specimens collected as bycatch during ground beetle pitfall sampling at terrestrial NEON sites.\r\nSampling\r\n\r\nCatch collected biweekly (every 14 days) during the green season\r\nTen distributed base plots (pre-2023) or six plots (2023 onward) per site\r\nFour traps (pre-2018) or three traps (2018 onward) per plot\r\n\r\nMethods\r\n\r\nPitfall traps (16-oz cups with propylene glycol)\r\n\r\nPreservation\r\n\r\nTrap contents sorted into identified adult Carabids, other invertebrates, herpetiles, and small mammals.\r\nIn this sample type, herptile catches from each trap are retained and archived separately (not pooled)\r\nStored in 95% ethanol at controlled temperature and humidity\r\n\r\n\r\n</p>","language":"eng","citation":{"text":"National Ecological Observatory Network (2026). NEON Biorepository Herptile Voucher Collection (Ground Beetle Sampling Bycatch Trap Sorting). Occurrence dataset https://doi.org/10.15468/zhkuay accessed via GBIF.org on 2026-10-26.","citationProvidedBySource":false},"contactsCitation":[],"lockedForAutoUpdate":false,"createdBy":"symb_neon","modifiedBy":"crawler.gbif.org","created":"2020-02-26T23:06:33.821+00:00","modified":"2026-10-07T18:27:08.339+00:00","contacts":[{"key":7640184,"type":"ORIGINATOR","primary":true,"userId":[],"position":[],"email":["biorepo@asu.edu"],"phone":[],"homepage":["https://biorepo.neonscience.org/portal/index.php"],"organization":"NEON Biorepository Portal","address":[],"createdBy":"crawler.gbif.org","modifiedBy":"crawler.gbif.org","created":"2026-10-07T18:27:08.312+00:00","modified":"2026-10-07T18:27:08.312+00:0